sheet('配料与螺丝总量：不要重复下单','采购基准包含备件；先扣除原套件内已有数量。未知价格留空，不作零元。',table(stock,['物料','本版总量／排法'])+'<h2>先后顺序</h2><ol><li>空框找方 → 底板／工作木台／相机木条。</li><li>顶平片与PP顶环 → 上斗 → 后梁、承托与导向。</li><li>打印舵机架、铝板、连杆 → 开关手推标定。</li><li>双摄／灯槽／遮光片 → BOX原壳 → 机外低压盒。</li><li>断6V手推全程；空载后才单豆，卡豆不持续顶。</li></ol>',table(fas,['规格','装机','采购基准'])+'<p>另有M2内内8mm隔柱8用／10基准，BOX20mm通孔隔柱4用／6基准。M3大垫片φ9共158用；M5槽内螺母60用。总表以CSV为准。</p><p>1:1孔位模板在templates/，单独100%打印并核50mm标尺。A3本图册不是1:1下料模板。</p>')
css='''@page{size:A3 landscape;margin:10mm}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font:11pt/1.55 system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;color:#2a424f}.sheet{width:400mm;height:277mm;page-break-after:always;position:relative;padding-bottom:12mm;overflow:hidden}.sheet:last-child{page-break-after:auto}header{height:31mm;border-bottom:.4mm solid #315a70;margin-bottom:7mm}header small{font-size:9pt;color:#607f90}h1{font-size:23pt;margin:1mm 0}header p{margin:0;color:#55717e}main{display:grid;grid-template-columns:228mm 162mm;gap:10mm}h2{font-size:14pt;line-height:1.4;margin:2mm 0 3mm}p{margin:3mm 0}ol{padding-left:6mm;margin:3mm 0}li{margin:2mm 0}figure{margin:0 0 4mm}figure img{width:228mm;height:148.5mm;object-fit:contain;background:#dfe8ee}figcaption{font-size:9pt;color:#597887;margin-top:1mm}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:10pt;line-height:1.45}td,th{border:.2mm solid #b8cbd5;padding:1.8mm 2.2mm;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}th{background:#edf3f6}tr{break-inside:avoid}.fast{background:#edf3f6;border-left:1mm solid #315f75;padding:3mm 4mm;font-size:10pt}.stack{width:153mm;height:85mm;display:block}.note{font-size:9.5pt;color:#677b85}footer{position:absolute;bottom:0;width:100%;height:8mm;border-top:.2mm solid #c9d6dd;padding-top:2mm;font-size:9pt;color:#68808d}@media screen{body{background:#d6dfe3}.sheet{margin:20px auto;background:white;padding:10mm;width:420mm;height:297mm}footer{width:400mm}}'''
